	(text "User interface (Rev A) - design notes\n\nTwo buttons (Mode/Next, Action/Select; long press allowed) to GND, internal pull-ups; DNP external pull-ups.\nPlacement (OD-27): front face in the strip below the LED field if the land pattern fits with LED and edge clearance;\notherwise side-actuated parts on the bottom edge. Contacts are enclosed under a plastic actuator.\nStatus LED on the rear, GPIO high = on. The power switch SW201 is on the power-tree sheet. Nothing measured."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
